From: NeoDarwin
Subject: [PATCH] internal: drop the unused os/transaction_private.h

internal.h includes libxpc's os/transaction_private.h, which Apple doesn't
publish, and nothing in libdarwin uses the os_transaction interface.

Rebase-risk: low (one include).
---
diff --git a/libdarwin/internal.h b/libdarwin/internal.h
--- a/libdarwin/internal.h
+++ b/libdarwin/internal.h
@@ -62,7 +62,6 @@
 
 #define OS_CRASH_ENABLE_EXPERIMENTAL_LIBTRACE 1
 #include <os/assumes.h>
-#include <os/transaction_private.h>
 #include <os/log_private.h>
 #include <os/alloc_once_private.h>
 
